        "# 3.05 Boolean Expressions — Homework Hack\n",
        "**SFI Backend Validator**\n",
        "\n",
        "Completed homework based on the supplied lesson prompt."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "id": "c6f69c48",
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "# Homework Hack - SFI Backend Validator\n",
        "\n",
        "existing_spec_numbers = [\"1.1\", \"2.1\"]\n",
        "valid_categories = [\"Auto Racing\", \"Drag Racing\"]\n",
        "\n",
        "test_records = [\n",
        "    {\n",
        "        \"product_name\": \"Multiple Disc Clutch Assemblies\",\n",
        "        \"category\": \"Auto Racing\",\n",
        "        \"spec_number\": \"1.2\",\n",
        "        \"effective_date\": \"Feb. 9, 2006\"\n",
        "    },\n",
        "    {\n",
        "        \"product_name\": \"Replacement Flywheels\",\n",
        "        \"category\": \"Street Car\",\n",
        "        \"spec_number\": \"3.1\",\n",
        "        \"effective_date\": \"Jan. 1, 2026\"\n",
        "    },\n",
        "    {\n",
        "        \"product_name\": \"Existing Flywheel Record\",\n",
        "        \"category\": \"Drag Racing\",\n",
        "        \"spec_number\": \"1.1\",\n",
        "        \"effective_date\": \"Jan. 1, 2026\"\n",
        "    }\n",
        "]\n",
        "\n",
        "def validate_record(record):\n",
        "    has_product_name = bool(record.get(\"product_name\", \"\").strip())\n",
        "    valid_category = record.get(\"category\") in valid_categories\n",
        "    has_spec_number = bool(record.get(\"spec_number\", \"\").strip())\n",
        "    has_effective_date = bool(record.get(\"effective_date\", \"\").strip())\n",
        "    duplicate_spec = record.get(\"spec_number\") in existing_spec_numbers\n",
        "\n",
        "    is_valid = (\n",
        "        has_product_name\n",
        "        and valid_category\n",
        "        and has_spec_number\n",
        "        and has_effective_date\n",
        "        and not duplicate_spec\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "    return is_valid\n",
        "\n",
        "for record in test_records:\n",
        "    status = \"ACCEPTED\" if validate_record(record) else \"REJECTED\"\n",
        "    print(\n",
        "        f\"{record['product_name']} | \"\n",
        "        f\"category={record['category']} | \"\n",
        "        f\"spec={record['spec_number']} | {status}\"\n",
        "    )"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "bc3bafca",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "### Boolean logic used\n",
        "\n",
        "The record is accepted only when **all** required conditions are true:\n",
        "\n",
        "- product name is not empty\n",
        "- category is accepted\n",
        "- spec number is not empty\n",
        "- effective date is present\n",
        "- the spec number is **not** already in the backend\n",
        "\n",
        "The duplicate check uses `not`, while the required checks are combined with `and`."
      ]
    }
